    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contain is a first-person cooperative tactical shooter, but if you like you can play as a Lone Wolf. There is an organization that directs many task forces that are trying to control objects of supernatural origin that have fallen from space. The story centers on a special task force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/47a2cc36e53e969c2ebac2f67f3bc1f4.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/70ebb75ee27d73ca67bc5f81a276db35.poster.avif?t=1752313142\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/70ebb75ee27d73ca67bc5f81a276db35.webm?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/70ebb75ee27d73ca67bc5f81a276db35.mp4?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize your character from basic outfit and gear to in-depth customization, you decide on every pouch and attachment placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/09e3328e71b3252d5f2c80ce80d021ac.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8d166a88eb1a503c095e6cc2e3896598.poster.avif?t=1752313142\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8d166a88eb1a503c095e6cc2e3896598.webm?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8d166a88eb1a503c095e6cc2e3896598.mp4?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like your outfit and gear, you can fully customize your guns with a gunsmith system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8764731d38f3197f8815b875bfcbd4dd.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/0bfa66286b213b47b128505b3511a8a6.poster.avif?t=1752313142\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/0bfa66286b213b47b128505b3511a8a6.webm?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/0bfa66286b213b47b128505b3511a8a6.mp4?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calculated teamwork is essential for all Entry Teams. Practice in the kill house and try your equipment before the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/018073ca52e15d26d4a3beb32f2fbec8.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div>You will be able to play all the missions by yourself as a Lone Wolf. <i>But we are also planning to add A.I. teammates with a complete commanding system.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contain is a first-person cooperative tactical shooter, but if you like you can play as a Lone Wolf. There is an organization that directs many task forces that are trying to control objects of supernatural origin that have fallen from space. The story centers on a special task force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/47a2cc36e53e969c2ebac2f67f3bc1f4.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/70ebb75ee27d73ca67bc5f81a276db35.poster.avif?t=1752313142\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/70ebb75ee27d73ca67bc5f81a276db35.webm?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/70ebb75ee27d73ca67bc5f81a276db35.mp4?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize your character from basic outfit and gear to in-depth customization, you decide on every pouch and attachment placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/09e3328e71b3252d5f2c80ce80d021ac.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8d166a88eb1a503c095e6cc2e3896598.poster.avif?t=1752313142\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8d166a88eb1a503c095e6cc2e3896598.webm?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8d166a88eb1a503c095e6cc2e3896598.mp4?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like your outfit and gear, you can fully customize your guns with a gunsmith system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/8764731d38f3197f8815b875bfcbd4dd.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/0bfa66286b213b47b128505b3511a8a6.poster.avif?t=1752313142\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/0bfa66286b213b47b128505b3511a8a6.webm?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/0bfa66286b213b47b128505b3511a8a6.mp4?t=1752313142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calculated teamwork is essential for all Entry Teams. Practice in the kill house and try your equipment before the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/018073ca52e15d26d4a3beb32f2fbec8.webp?t=1752313142\" /></div>You will be able to play all the missions by yourself as a Lone Wolf. <i>But we are also planning to add A.I. teammates with a complete commanding system.</i></p>",
